<title>BRAZIL: INTERVIEW-Venezuela cenbank has no forex worries.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW-Venezuela cenbank has no forex worries.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan Central Bank President Antonio Casas Gonzalez said Monday there was no cause for alarm over foreign exchange movements and that policy had not changed.</p>
<p>&quot;There's really no reason for alarm or for saying that we've changed (policy),&quot; Casas told Reuters during a visit to the Brazilian capital Brasilia.</p>
</text>
